# AI agent session state, memory and scratch. These hold the local session
# records, long-term memory notes for the agents working this workspace, and
# throwaway probe scripts. They are working state, not project assets, and the
# repo has a public mirror -- so they must never be committed. Ignoring them
# does NOT delete anything: the files stay on disk untouched.
.zcode/
.trae/
.workbuddy/

# Authoring scratch space. Empty placeholder tree today; the loaders and the
# authoring tools write session/draft/compiled state into it at runtime.
AWAKE/workspace/

# Python bytecode caches left behind by the tooling scripts.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Downloaded payloads and regenerable local outputs sitting next to real sources.
# These are the ones a careless `git add` would sweep in -- and this repo has a
# public mirror, so a 2.3 GB accident is not a private mistake.
# Ignoring does NOT delete anything: the files stay on disk untouched.
#   * tools/_reranker_survey/dl/     -- 9 ONNX reranker candidates, 2.2 GB download cache
#   * tools/*/native/                -- onnxruntime native runtimes staged by one-off probes
#     NOTE: do NOT widen this to **/native/ -- AWAKE/framework/MarcusAwakeStorage/native/
#     holds the framework's shipped native libraries and IS tracked on purpose.
#   * AWAKE/artifacts/               -- assemble / game-dir-deploy backups, fully regenerable
#   * AWAKE/_backup_dist_runtime_*/  -- pre-deploy dist snapshots of the runtime service
#   * _wtest_ps/                     -- PowerShell write-probe scratch (.bin)
#   * projection/_archive-alias-tighten-20260920/
#     -- 09-20 凌晨「别名收紧」与「镜像同步」两道工序之前的手工快照（1392 文件／14 MB）。
#        当时手工拷是因为镜像侧有未提交改动、git checkout 回不到同步前状态；
#        如今正本 workspace/full-geo1/authoring 已 489→564、镜像 authoring-out 已 302→569
#        （之后又加了军事／经济／暗面／互引边四批）⇒ 快照只剩「回滚到那一刻」的价值，
#        而回滚等于把这四批退掉。故拉黑，不删（文件仍在磁盘）。
AWAKE/docs/worldbook-migration/projection/_archive-alias-tighten-20260920/
AWAKE/tools/_reranker_survey/dl/
AWAKE/tools/*/native/
AWAKE/artifacts/
AWAKE/_backup_dist_runtime_*/
_wtest_ps/
